                    "Release metadata согласованы: accepted=$AYANA_ACCEPTED_FEATURE_CHECKPOINT; current=$AYANA_CURRENT_FEATURE_RELEASE; Personal Search=$AYANA_PERSONAL_SEARCH_ENGINE_RELEASE."
